  "title": "Yummy Bran Muffins",
  "description": "Just because they're healthy, doesn't mean they can't taste delicious! A hint of chocolate and spice really makes these bran muffins great!",
  "authors": [
    "Chef Doctor Ruth"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:13:07-05:00",
